  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "水域棲地保育",
    "sub_ename": "AQUATIC HABITAT CONSERVATION",
    "describe_ch": "1.簡介台灣水域生態與棲地特性與其調查評估方法，和水利工程的影響與改善方向。\r\n2、認識工程「生態檢核」流程，在工程執行過程中應用「生態專業參與」和「民眾參與」，達到保育水域棲地目標。\r\n3、藉由課堂實作、案例分析與野外勘查，培養學生執行生態檢核，與詳實撰寫生態檢核表之能力。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "1. Introduce aquatic ecosystem and habitat characteristics of Taiwan and their investigation and evaluation methods, as well as hydraulic engineering impacts and its improvement directions.\r\n2. To understand the process of \"Ecological Check\", and to apply \"Ecological Professional Participation\" and \"Citizen Participation\" in the engineering process to achieve the goal of aquatic habitat conservation.\r\n3. Through classroom exercises, case discussion and field survey, to train students to perform \"Ecological Check\" and practice its forms.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "1、瞭解台灣水域生態與棲地特性與河溪工程影響。\t",
      "describe_en": "To understand aquatic ecosystem and habitat characteristics of Taiwan, and river engineering impacts.\t"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "2、認識生態檢核作業之流程與生態檢核表實務操作。\t",
      "describe_en": "To understand the process of \"Ecological Check\", and practice its forms.\t"
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "3、訓練經由現勘與調查而掌握生態議題與提出相應對策之能力。",
      "describe_en": "\tTo train the ability to grasp ecological issues through field surveys and investigations and propose corresponding countermeasures."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "4、評析近年水域相關正負面案例。\t",
      "describe_en": "To comment on positive or negative cases related to aquatic ecosystem and habitat in recent years."
    }
  ],
